		{"id":"1fa3288add444f9d","type":"text","text":"##### 普通索引\n- 创建表: `INDEX (column1,...)`\n- 添加索引: `CREATE INDEX name ON table(column1,...)`","x":835,"y":68,"width":403,"height":97},
		{"id":"44c2055e915fd9d7","type":"text","text":"##### 前缀索引\n- 创建表: `INDEX (column(len))`\n- 添加索引: `CREATE INDEX name ON table(column(len))`","x":835,"y":178,"width":403,"height":97},
		{"id":"db2593a11e58b775","type":"text","text":"##### 主键索引\n- 创建表: `PRIMARY KEY(column) USING BTREE`","x":880,"y":-162,"width":358,"height":73},
		{"id":"9f16abacf19503ac","type":"text","text":"##### 唯一索引 ---多字段:联合索引\n- 创建表: `UNIQUE KEY(column1,...)`\n- 添加索引: `CREATE UNIQUE INDEX name ON table(column1,...)`","x":880,"y":-67,"width":358,"height":124},
		{"id":"8e8cb46f4df66138","type":"text","text":"##### B+ Tree索引\n- 主键索引: 叶子节点 ---实际数据\n\t- 主键 > 非空UNIQUE > 隐式自增\n- 二级索引: 叶子节点 ---主键\n\t- 覆盖索引 --- 不回表\n\t- no: 回表->主键索引","x":512,"y":-168,"width":296,"height":182},
		{"id":"595d364df262cb90","type":"text","text":"##### 索引失效\n- 左模糊/左右模糊\n- f(索引)/计算\n- 联合索引最左匹配原则\n- WHERE...OR...有字段没有索引\n- 字符串与数字比较 ---CAST()","x":512,"y":30,"width":296,"height":183},
		{"id":"406adb7614e9dc5d","type":"text","text":"##### 建不建索引?\n**建**\n- 字段唯一\n- 经常`WHERE`/`GROUP BY`/`ORDER BY`\n\n**不建**\n- 不经常`WHERE`/`GROUP BY`/`ORDER BY`\n- 大量重复\n- 表数据少\n- 经常更新","x":512,"y":231,"width":296,"height":296},
		{"id":"4ad9bb7c3c9a6b70","type":"text","text":"##### 锁\n- 行级锁\n- 表级锁","x":-499,"y":951,"width":139,"height":115},
		{"id":"a271e057abba2c5f","type":"text","text":"##### 事务隔离级别\n- 读未提交\n- 读已提交\n- 可重复读\n- 串行化","x":-499,"y":1083,"width":139,"height":153},
		{"id":"034282e0376cd122","type":"text","text":"##### MVCC\n- 读已提交: 每次*select* 前生成READ VIEW\n- 可重复读: 开启事务时生成READ \n###### read view\n- 该事务id/活跃事务id表/最大活跃id/最小活跃id\n- 聚簇: 修改数据的事务id/上一版本指针","x":-331,"y":991,"width":371,"height":200},
		{"id":"24bb4a8a47352329","type":"text","text":"##### 保证事务\n- redo log\n- undo log\n- MVCC","x":-392,"y":792,"width":119,"height":125},
		{"id":"c764b6b6d3417770","type":"text","text":"##### 并发问题\n- 脏读: 读未提交\n- 不可重复读\n- 幻读: 记录数量不同","x":-255,"y":792,"width":181,"height":125},
		{"id":"0dd6186d62461f21","x":-970,"y":740,"width":320,"height":328,"type":"text","text":"##### 日志\n"},
		{"id":"7e1460ff63042b7c","type":"text","text":"##### 锁\n>`SELECT *　FROM table WHERE ... FOR UPDATE;`\n- time: 执行语句上锁, *执行`commit`解锁*\n- entity: 符合索引条件的行对象(禁止添加/修改/删除)  ---无索引则全锁\n- 排他锁: 禁止读写\n\n>`FOR　SHARE`\n- 共享锁: 可读","x":-562,"y":158,"width":294,"height":339},
		{"id":"aa8aae194358952e","x":350,"y":796,"width":310,"height":415,"color":"#ffffff","type":"text","text":"> `explain`查看sql的执行计划: 索引/外排/索引覆盖...\n- key: 实际使用索引\n- possible_keys: 可能使用的索引\n- key_len\n- row: 扫描行数\n- **type:数据扫描类型**\n\t- ALL:全表扫描\n\t- index:全索引扫描\n\t- range:索引范围扫描\n\t- const:主键/唯一索引扫描\n- extra:\n\t- using filesort\n\t- using temporary:创建临时表\n\t- using index"},
		{"id":"377f81ef7ae2fa59","x":700,"y":794,"width":220,"height":50,"type":"text","text":"查看表索引\n`SHOW INDEX/KEYS FROM table`"},
		{"id":"31ff517cae438446","x":699,"y":864,"width":289,"height":50,"type":"text","text":"强制使用索引: `FORCE INDEX (idx)`"},
		{"id":"a4ddd68f51e1efbe","x":702,"y":952,"width":250,"height":191,"color":"1","type":"text","text":"###### 查询优化\n- 全表查询? 没使用索引?\n- 创建/优化索引\n- 查询优化\n- 优化数据库\n- 引入缓存"}
